{"server":"cn","storyId":"act13side_level_act13side_st03","groupId":"act13side","stageId":"act13side_st03","title":"酣眠的城市","storyCode":"NL-ST-3","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act13side/level_act13side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"f3f6eab1f2c5d52f188b8e44593029d84083dc0ef8ed5b5e109ade9242a3a87d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"卡西米尔 纯剧情3"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"确认卡瓦莱利亚基陷入紧急情况。\n确认讯号代码正确。确认部队识别码正确。\n全队听令。\n撤下伪装，进城。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G09"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......距离电力完全恢复，还需要一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的各位已经在指引下回到了房间休息，如果二位想要确认的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士，我想去看看各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"事发突然，也许会有一些干员弄不清状况，这些天对感染者的抗议，也让干员们积攒了不少压力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"那就有劳阿米娅了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没关系的，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"这些天一直是博士在应付各种商业洽谈和社交活动，其实我还挺过意不去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"趁着这个机会，赶紧休息一下吧。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊哈哈，博士已经很累了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟从昨天开始就一直在应付那些企业家，嗓子都哑了吧？"}]},{"label":"真的不需要我帮忙吗？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，有芙蓉小姐在，应该不会出什么差错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是去确认一下各位的情况，很快就会回来的。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请阿米娅小姐放心吧，您不在的时间里，我会照顾好博士的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"那么我先下去啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......{@nickname}博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近商业联合会有一些动向，恐怕会对罗德岛不利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加上现在的停电事件，恐怕下一步会是更加明目张胆的阴谋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近......请千万不要离开我的视线。当然，您要是自愿留在我的身边，那是再好不过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"想出去逛逛吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘻嘻，您突然这么解风情，倒是让我有些吃惊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？难道发生了什么好事吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"砾小姐，您是怎么看待商业联合会的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您不是问过类似的问题了吗？怎么，是想多听一听我的声音吗？可以哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是卡西米尔的蛀虫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"商人们联合起来，腐蚀骑士和城市，最终达成他们自己的目的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"商业联合会，如其名，只是“联合”罢了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"利益是连系他们的纽带，他们当然可被分割。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不过是与骑士们的对抗，让他们看起来，像一个整体。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您做了什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"商业联合会的常务董事大致有四类人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘻......愿闻其详。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"急于推进时代，取缔骑士阶层的激进分子。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"守旧却扎实，一步一脚印的稳健派。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"没有任何立场，只要有利益就趋之若鹜的逐利者。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最后一种呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"对于如今的罗德岛而言，还为时尚早。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"贸然接触，反而危险。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您的意思是，联合会内部有分歧？而您......已经抓住了那些分歧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"很难说是分歧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"他们根本就不可能存在“团结”。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"皆为利来，皆为利往。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但您不过初来乍到，只是通过发言人的渠道，结识了一部分常务董事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您怎么敢如此断言？一旦您选错了信任对象，其后果绝非监正会可以承担......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛从未考虑过依赖他人牺牲来达成自己的目的。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"您总不能认为，我是真的毫无牺牲觉悟去参加那些宴会的吧？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"砾","speakerId":"avg_237_gravel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您当然不。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们还有时间可以浪费吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于感染者的通缉令已经发出，等到大隔断的影响过去，你们无路可逃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，顺便一提，之所以叫“大隔断”，是因为在失去核心电力后各地块会出现短暂的漂移现象......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，联合会周遭的地块连接都中断了，你们逃不出去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃......该死......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......好像不是可以正面打赢的对手啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢你总算理解了你早该理解的事情。那我再问一遍，要不要把东西交给我？那我可以放走你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，无胄盟什么时候这么好心了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......心情问题吧，终于从漫长的......斗争里看到了曙光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从玻利瓦尔的废墟，到卡西米尔的平原，最后来到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有正常人会觉得杀人是一件快乐的事情，只有那些养尊处优的蠢货喜欢观赏他人流血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你能拯救我，感染者，我也可以帮你摧毁无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，就算你说的是真的，我也不打算把这东西交给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经厌倦了受他人操纵的日子了，无胄盟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，看这一炮如何！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......咳咳......搞什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"跑，小灰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这座城市的构造区乱跑，小心失足跌进引擎里，变成肉末啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可跑不了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——唔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"小灰！小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I12"},{"type":"narration","text":"青色的箭矢贯穿了焰尾骑士的盔甲。\n索娜试图格挡，但是巨大的冲击力依然让她娇小的身躯失去控制。\n她在半空中挣扎，飞向城区地块之间的间隙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"索娜——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（......歪了点，刚才突然眼前黑了一下......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疲劳产生的错觉吗......？不，确实是被干扰了......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——罗伊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失去理智了吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧啧，这么近的距离开火，你是打算同归于尽了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你竟然......对索娜......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实有些不小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还没确认那枚芯片是不是真的被销毁了，这很危险，我可不敢担这个责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"少废话！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（该怎么办，赶紧杀掉灰毫，想办法下去确认一下尸体吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不，这也太危险了，而且电力就快要恢复了，我可不想被夹在铁板中间啊。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"我要你血债血偿——！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直来直往，失去理智之后你的动作还真是好看穿啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格蕾纳蒂","speakerId":"avg_npc_123","isRemote":false,"text":"——是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，竟然是我大意了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......跑了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，那股怒火是装出来的......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......为了感染者而成为骑士。\n为了感染者而奋战至死。\n我很荣幸。\n很荣幸......死于一场荣耀的事业。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......虽然很想大义凛然地这么说，但是......这是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗伊还在这附近，他一定会发现我的法术，我们不能久留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通知你的同伴，让她逃走吧，如有必要，我会在暗中帮助她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......喂，小灰，我没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"别让他察觉到，找机会逃走，我趁着帮你挡箭的时候把芯片扔进你兜里了，确认一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不用回复，我们回头见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......你接住的我？怎么做到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"法术的应用方法多种多样，经过刻苦学习的莱塔尼亚人，无论其原本法术是什么性质，几乎都能使用基础的法术形式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是，烛骑士，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样的大骑士，为什么要救我......救一个感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有个人想要见你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不能说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......你也知道我们正在做什么事，瘫痪城市，袭击联合会......我可没有时间郊游喔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不信任我，也情有可原。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"只要看有些人一眼，你就能从她的眼里读出他们的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，这招可不是百分之百准确的，但是现在情况紧急，对吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，怎么遇上这种事，路也不通，车也打不到，今晚又回不了家了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"该死的组长，说什么报表昨天就该做完......一天能做完个鬼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊啊啊，怎、怎么了！？？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让开，否则我就连你一起射穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"咿————别、别，我这就让——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别乱动，小哥，你也不想脑袋搬家吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"但、但是她让我动——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个张口闭口就要杀你的人，你会相信吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我——我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托兰，躲在普通人身后，是不是有点太难看了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也有点道理，我数到三？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"求、求求你们了，别管我，别管我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"咿呀——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"两个疯子，两个疯子——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"这条路通向哪儿——等等，那里是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士先生！骑士老爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"我是玫瑰报业的员工，您帮帮我，您知道我们吗？我会向编辑部推荐您的，那边有两个不法之徒——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"——咿——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的箭是用不完的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我还是第一次好几分钟没能追上猎物......了不起，托兰·卡什。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的目的就是拖住我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......你呢，你的目的是陪我玩吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你的人头值很多钱，任何时候，我们都需要钱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？你家里有病重的弟弟吗？还是有需要赡养的老父亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这份工作能为我带来你无法想象的财富，赏金猎人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们比你们，比骑士，比任何一个卡西米尔人都更懂得这个社会的运作规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们只是选了一条捷径，等今晚的猎杀结束之后，我们将迎来新的开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在，好像又有一个蠢货想要搅局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......在这座，死气沉沉的城市里......还能见到这样的夜空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"这才是我所熟悉的夜晚，让这人造的孽物搁浅于此......放空这座城市的血，做得好，不知名的反抗者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是一位奇怪的骑士，私斗可不挣钱啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，闹剧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sportsbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都没事吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"姐姐！我刚把备用电池找出来......唔......这盏灯就不开了吧？感觉撑不了多久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......看来大家都没事。老弗和科瓦尔去外面查看情况了，一会回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛恩纳呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔待在家里，说是难得可以从工作中解脱出来，想一个人待一会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"闪灵姐姐和夜莺姐姐呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她们担心博士被无胄盟盯上，已经赶回感染者收容中心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，她们都是很可靠的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"不......只是......我好像还是不知道姐姐的任何事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，是我坚持不让你们有任何接触的......我不能把博士他们卷入我自己的事情中来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但也许迟早有一天，你们会相逢、相识。也许有一天，玛莉娅，你会登上那艘船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"理想者的光辉终究会指引所有人，即使他们的前路各不相同，信念迥异，也没有什么能动摇他们心中的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"......就像......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像骑士小说里的骑士那样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"我回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"真的一片漆黑啊......隔壁卖手电筒的今天都要断货了吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"光头马丁","speakerId":"avg_npc_107","isRemote":false,"text":"玛嘉烈，你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_120","isRemote":false,"text":"现在外面是一团乱啦，我看，我们就老老实实待在这里，等着电力恢复如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老工匠","speakerId":"avg_npc_101","isRemote":false,"text":"就干等着？本来今天是不是也有比赛来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来是决出第一个八强骑士的日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佐菲娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你有关注血骑士的动向吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解过一些......他是这赛季从选拔阶段到特锦赛的无败王者......不仅如此......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他还是感染者的英雄。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们要去哪儿？不是我抱怨，我真的没有太多时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......冠军墙展厅？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一次秘密的会面，还请您不要声张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"是哪个骑士要见我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骑士吗......说的没错，确实是一位可敬的骑士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，别紧张......是位年纪有些大的女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先进去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......你不进来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她可能是卡西米尔为数不多的几位，让我有些害怕的人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦......手握烛剑的烛骑士也会有害怕的人？那我真的没问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可能不太一样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烛骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_215_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟名义上，她算我的半个养母。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G02"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（和联合会一样的紧急电源......没有被大隔断的断电影响吗......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（骑士和......联合会......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"（......还在这片黑夜里闪着光。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"灯光扑闪。\n打断了索娜的思绪。\n骑士和资本一并避开了这浓稠的夜色。\n谁会在今夜溺亡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......焰尾骑士，索娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快过来些，让我好好看看你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您是......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎。我今天不是以公务之身来见你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了......感染者骑士和监正会的一些骑士，做了笔交易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是骑士协会和监正会议员，德米安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者为了能在大骑士领活下去，答应在他的配合下，进行了本次行动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四城大隔断......监正会默许了这件事再次发生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这面墙......这些骑士，他们本该成为真正的英雄，而不是以这种姿态，被人关注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你不感到......悲哀吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......悲哀，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"但我为感染者们至今仍不能受到公正的待遇而悲哀，为那些沉溺在享乐与欲望之中的人们而悲哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"为每一个......努力活着，却举步维艰的卡西米尔人......而悲哀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是漂亮的就职演说，小松鼠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"监正会能让我们过普通的生活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手续、公文、国民院认可的法律文件。当然，监正会都会为你办妥。这是老德米安答应你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你身上的源石结晶呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我欣赏你们，红松骑士团，但是你们必须克服的，是一些更模糊的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后，德米安会和你们对接的。就相信他吧，虽然办法笨了点，但他有的是想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，我的骑士团也快到了，赶紧去找你的同伴们会合吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，告诉薇薇安娜一声，让她偶尔有空也来陪我吃顿饭吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"索娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_122","isRemote":false,"text":"............骑士意味着什么，女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每个人都有不一样的答案，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会想听到我的答案的，我们这些老家伙呀，走过太多的路啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，小松鼠，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年长的骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_210_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去看看卡西米尔的朝阳，是不是还那样炽热。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......追丢了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后再发布围剿任务比较有效率吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，怎么了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什......多少？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......卓越的剑术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我可不想继续陪你浪费时间啊，骑士老兄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个疯子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了托兰之后，就立刻撤退好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在陪“公会领袖”和梦魇捉迷藏，有什么事一会再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我立刻就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"游戏到此为止了，托兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要逃走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有你也是，梦魇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！你是梦魇！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时停手吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......来卡瓦莱利亚基寻找同胞和试炼的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"别把荣耀的传统说得如此轻浮，卡西米尔人，你没有这个资格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，只是好心提醒你一句，梦魇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别在我们这里白费力气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这倒是句公道话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"逐魇骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_225","isRemote":false,"text":"......无凭无据......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，后会无期，蠢货。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"交通还没恢复吗？我听说有些地方已经通电了啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_219","isRemote":false,"text":"这么大的损失，难道骑士协会不应该赔偿我们吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"说得没错！政府应该补偿旅游津贴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......冰箱里的鲜肉没问题吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......确定了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道吗，他们中的任何一个人，我们都可以独自解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但两个人，就需要我们联手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三个人，将是一场空前绝后的苦战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是三个及以上......那可以视作一支战术小队了，无胄盟承担不起这个损失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是超过双手之数，把无胄盟全体成员叫上，怕是都不够他们杀的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这我知道，我还是见过他们的，不劳你好心提醒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岗哨看到多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十来个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太糟糕了......在这个节骨眼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。已经通知董事会了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是想攻陷四城联合吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这不可能！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这不可能......军事顾问呢！监视征战骑士的人呢！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前监正会调动的那批征战骑士，上一次汇报的时候他们在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......五百七十三公里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"常规征战骑士小队的行军速度不可能来得及......太快了，这太快了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道监正会背着联合会，调动了另一支？不对，这不可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......慢着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......银枪皮加索斯的急行军......最快的一次记录是多少......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......他们......伪装了自己的军队识别码......？甚至，伪装了自己的甲胄和长枪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔骑士","speakerId":"avg_npc_219","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？是不是亮一些了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_222","isRemote":false,"text":"看那边！路那头的光芒！那边一定是恢复电力了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......灯还是灭的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"那更像是......月光......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"月光。\n通电玻璃管的兴盛让现代人逐渐遗忘了月光原本的模样。\n这座片刻黑暗的城市——\n——已经被银光照亮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"23_I01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"围观的路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":".....................那、那也是骑士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡西米尔骑士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"征、征战骑士！？在这里！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"骑士穿过人群。\n穿过这座被誉为骑士之城的城市。\n城市不承认这群骑士。\n正如骑士也不承认这座城。\n他们从遥远的边境要塞而来。\n他们的身上沾染着清晰可闻的泥土气息。\n夹杂着血肉，白骨，埋葬在战场上的无数英豪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G06"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......通知无胄盟全体成员，不管手头有什么活儿，全部停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想惹麻烦就什么都别做，绝对别轻举妄动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗伊","speakerId":"avg_npc_209_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫妮克？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫妮克","speakerId":"avg_npc_208_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边......那个人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怀念吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我倒是很怀念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怀念那个......还误以为这片大地没那么糟糕的时候，那本来是个意气风发的时代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛恩纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_108","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的没有任何想法，你是不会出现在这里的，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛恩纳，看看四周吧，这座城市睡着了，谁也未曾想过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"托兰","speakerId":"avg_npc_213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_23_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"报告！已经修复了一部分通讯线路——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——接通国民院副审官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"企业员工","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......副审官阁下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我要说什么，这批征战骑士未经许可进入大骑士领，已经触犯了第二法案的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"前国民院副审官杜克，涉嫌受贿、参与非法贸易、谋杀和渎职等多项罪名，已被依法拘留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"冷静选择你说的每一句话，发言人阁下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大骑士领因大断电处于紧急状态，监正会有权在城市处于紧急状态时派军入驻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电话那头的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还有什么疑问吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。打扰了，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......麦基先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"通讯基本恢复了，麦基先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看他们忙碌的样子......你觉得电话是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？当然是通讯工具......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。电话是现代社会的纺锤与犁，是编织这个现代社会的渠道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人马克维茨","speakerId":"avg_npc_211_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是伟大的象征，麦基先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"发言人麦基","speakerId":"avg_npc_212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"麦基一言未发。\n他只是突然从马克维茨身上感到了一种气势。\n这个数月前创业失败，一事无成，唯唯诺诺的人身上，有一种近乎天然的气势。\n他曾在不少人身上看到过这种气势。\n他们大都在变迁与博弈中血肉模糊，至于活下来的那些——\n——几乎都成为了某种形态的一部分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]}]}
